First-run launcher pin strength — 67 individual reverts

  [32mRED  [0m dismissing writes the DURABLE key, so the launcher never returns
         caught by: dismissal is session-scoped; only the checkbox suppresses durably
  [32mRED  [0m the checkbox is ignored, so nothing can ever suppress the launcher
         caught by: the checkbox writes and clears durable suppression, and a storage reset undoes it; a refused write takes the tick back instead of promising "never again"
  [32mRED  [0m unticking the box cannot take the suppression back
         caught by: the checkbox writes and clears durable suppression, and a storage reset undoes it; a refused write takes the tick back instead of promising "never again"
  [31mSTALE[0m the session flag is never read, so it re-nags on every reload
  [31mSTALE[0m the durable flag is never read, so the checkbox does nothing
  [32mRED  [0m ?welcome=1 no longer outranks suppression, so demos cannot replay it
         caught by: welcome params work in both directions and outrank both suppressions
  [32mRED  [0m ?welcome=0 stops suppressing
         caught by: welcome params work in both directions and outrank both suppressions
  [32mRED  [0m a share link gets the launcher over the view its author chose
         caught by: welcome params work in both directions and outrank both suppressions; a share link never sees the launcher — its author already chose the view
  [32mRED  [0m storage is read from a DEFAULT PARAMETER, outside every guard
         caught by: a THROWING storage getter still fails open — Safari private mode; no storage is touched from a default parameter position
  [32mRED  [0m shouldShowFirstRun resolves storage in its parameter list again
         caught by: a THROWING storage getter still fails open — Safari private mode; no storage is touched from a default parameter position
  [31mSTALE[0m the guarded resolver stops catching, so a hostile getter escapes
  [32mRED  [0m a blocked getItem throws instead of reading as "nothing stored"
         caught by: privacy-restricted storage fails open and every write stays best-effort
  [32mRED  [0m the key handler trusts the CLASS, so an invisible card eats ESC
         caught by: the key handler refuses to act for a card that is not really on screen
  [32mRED  [0m the launcher stops yielding and fights Cockpit/Scenes for ESC
         caught by: the launcher yields on engage and waits when a surface is already up
  [31mSTALE[0m nothing watches for another surface taking the screen
  [32mRED  [0m cockpit drops off the exclusive list and can stack with the launcher
         caught by: the JS and CSS lists of screen-claiming surfaces stay in step
  [31mSTALE[0m a scene hides the launcher in CSS but the JS never learns of it
  [32mRED  [0m yielding steals focus back from the surface that just took over
         caught by: the launcher yields on engage and waits when a surface is already up
  [31mSTALE[0m isTopmost stops hit-testing, so an unclassed overlay buries the card again
