         caught by: an overlay with NO class to watch still disarms the launcher
  [32mRED  [0m the launcher stops honouring a key another surface already claimed
         caught by: one ESC does one thing — the radio disclosure stops the launcher outright
  [31mSTALE[0m the radio disclosure returns to stopPropagation, so one ESC does two things
  [32mRED  [0m the "no timer" decision is deleted, so the next editor re-litigates it blind
